    {
      "source": "This interface is designed to act in a similar way to\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/ServletContainerInitializer.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>ServletContainerInitializer</code></a>, but have a lifecycle that's managed by Spring and\nnot the Servlet container.",
      "translation": "该接口旨在以与<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/ServletContainerInitializer.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>ServletContainerInitializer</code></a>类似的方式工作，但其生命周期由 Spring 管理，而非 Servlet 容器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "For configuration examples see <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/WebApplicationInitializer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web\"><code>WebApplicationInitializer</code></a>.",
      "translation": "有关配置示例，请参阅 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/WebApplicationInitializer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web\"><code>WebApplicationInitializer</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/ServletContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>ServletContext</code></a> with any servlets, filters, listeners\ncontext-params and attributes necessary for initialization.",
      "translation": "配置给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/ServletContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>ServletContext</code></a>，并设置任何 servlet、过滤器和监听器所需的初始化 context-params 和 attributes。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/ServletException.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\">ServletException</a></code> - if any call against the given <code>ServletContext</code>\nthrows a <code>ServletException</code>",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/ServletException.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\">ServletException</a></code> - 如果针对给定的 <code>ServletContext</code> 的任何调用抛出 <code>ServletException</code>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>servletContext</code> - the <code>ServletContext</code> to initialize",
      "translation": "<code>servletContext</code> - 要初始化的 <code>ServletContext</code>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This is a functional interface and can therefore be used as the assignment target for a lambda expression or method reference.",
      "translation": "这是一个函数式接口，因此可用作 Lambda 表达式或方法引用的赋值目标。",
      "count": 1
    },
